					<li>
						<strong>Closed Distance-Based System:</strong> Motorists tap in at their entry interchange (where an electronic timestamp and entry tag are logged) and tap out at their exit interchange. The toll fee is computed precisely per kilometer based on the distance between the two interchanges. Examples include NLEX north of Bocaue, SLEX south of Alabang, SCTEX, TPLEX, and CALAX.
